Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.55,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Episode 5 - Itu Jawaban Terakhir\Nyang Diberikan)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Episode 6 - Pelindung Dunia)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurut perhitunganku, kita akan menyusul\Ntarget sekitar 3 menit 40 detik lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di ujung pengejaran ini\Nada pembunuh dan agen, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya. Mana senapan musketmu\Nyang biasanya itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belum lama ini,\Naku berikan ke kenalanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang mau banget saat melihatnya,\Njadi kuberikan saja padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enteng banget.\NKau anggap apa peninggalan Siesta?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi apa kau punya strategi\Nuntuk menang tanpa senjata?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Tidak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada, toh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimihiko pasti punya rencana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya, kamu tidak mau\Nmemberitahuku, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah terlihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Robot itu masih belum rusak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisi dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh juga dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hukuman... ditegakkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berlebihan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sirius verβ memang mantap,\Ndaya tembaknya bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mentang-mentang pernah kalah sekali,\Ncara balas dendammu ngeri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar aku yang melawannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimihiko, kamu mundur saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vampir itu... Kamu juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak sekali keberadaan tidak normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemikiran itu sepertinya keliru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Kamu mau menceramahiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak punya hak untuk itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Siesta pasti tidak akan\Nmenyalahkan orang lain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atas kegagalannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mudah emosional
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah kebiasaan burukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona juga begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pertama kali bertemu\NNona lima tahun lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya bermula dari perintah\Nsebuah organisasi untuk membunuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudah, deh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terserah kamu mau\Napakan aku sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah gagal membunuhmu,\Naku pasti dibunuh organisasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku tadi bilang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anggap aku mati di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, kamu tidak akan\Ndibunuh organisasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa untungnya bagimu melakukan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa melakukan pekerjaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengaruh orang tuaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang tuaku juga seorang prajurit\Ndan mata-mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang tuaku melindungi\Ndunia ini dari balik layar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itulah aku mengikuti orang tuaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bangga pada pekerjaan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh. Sama denganku, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:04:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga melakukan pekerjaan ini\Nkarena suatu tujuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku tidak boleh\Ndibunuh olehmu sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau kamu juga sama denganku,\Nkamu tak boleh mati sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya kamu mau membantuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, tolong bantu aku setelah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syarat negosiasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menyelamatkan\Nnyawamu kali ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai gantinya, tolong bantu\Npekerjaanku sesekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah mencoba\Nmembunuhmu, tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau minta tolong\Nkepada pembunuh sepertiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat itu, aku tahu secara naluri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sebenarnya tidak butuh bantuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.98,0:04:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu cuma agar aku menerima\Nbantuannya tanpa sungkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya dia bilang negosiasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memberiku liontin ini\Nsebagai bukti kesepakatan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona selalu melindungiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Organisasi tidak bisa menyentuhku\Nselama aku di samping Penjaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan setelah dia mati,\Naku langsung diatur bekerja
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk Penjaga lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan itu Kase Fuubi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, sekarang pun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau sudah berubah wujud seperti itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu bertarung menahan diri\Nagar tidak membunuhku lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa menahan diri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa tidak mau serius?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa masih berusaha melindungiku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa apa-apa setahun lalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya, aku bersumpah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau diperlakukan tidak layak\Ndi bawah perintahnya pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bersumpah untuk mengalahkan\NSPES menggantikan Nona!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi menang...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan melakukan apa pun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga kamu akan melakukan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Char, apa kau benar-benar\Nbisa menembaknya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudmu?\NKamu pikir aku bakal bimbang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meskipun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu adalah tubuh asli Siesta?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tubuh asli?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah ketahuan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak kapan kamu sadar, Kimihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah sejak kapan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pemicunya terjadi begitu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah pertarungan setahun lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tubuh Nona Siesta disimpan\Noleh seseorang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu dengan dibekali kecerdasan\Nbuatan dari ingatan Nona Siesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}serta ditanamkannya jantung\Nbuatan ke dalam tubuhku,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku pun terlahir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menduga seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga ingat bau Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi memang kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tubuhmu milik Nona,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}misiku tidak berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Warisan yang ditinggalkan\NSiesta adalah kita berempat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau mewarisi tekad Siesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak boleh ada satu pun yang mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi Nona adalah Penjaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misinya adalah mengalahkan SPES!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Char, menurutmu guru\Nyang kau cintai itu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lebih mengutamakan misi\Natau melindungi teman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kamu bisa\Ntersenyum bahagia begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gila!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bodoh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama kali...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pertama kalinya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu ucapkan kata itu padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noches!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku bilang kau itu naif.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupikir kamu orang\Nyang sedikit lebih bijak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya kamu sejenis\Ndengan bocah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noches!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luka setingkat ini
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih bisa diatasi dengan\Nprosedur penghentian darurat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang lebih penting...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dialah lawan yang harus kalian hadapi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan segera kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pura-pura tidak akur,\Nlalu sekarang bekerja sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar yakin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menghadapi dia berarti\Nkau akan kehilangan banyak hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah terlambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, kita kepung dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu orang dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana? Tinggal kamu sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau melanjutkan\Nperlawanan sia-siamu ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak peduli\Ndengan nasib dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja aku peduli!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau harus ada\Nsatu orang yang berkorban
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk menyelamatkan dunia,\NNona pasti tidak rela!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah dia sendiri yang berkorban\Nuntuk melindungi dunia ini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalianlah warisan terakhirnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu paham maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.55,0:11:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian juga harus melanjutkan\Ntekad Detektif Hebat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk mati demi dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terus terang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsunagi Nagisa tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia terlalu lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Warisilah tekadnya, jadilah Penjaga\Nsebagai Detektif Hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mengaguminya selama ini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bukan sekadar\Nmengagumi Detektif Hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengagumi seorang wanita\Nbernama Siesta yang cantik dan kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar orang membosankan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu meremehkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pikir bisa mengalahkanku\Ndalam duel satu lawan satu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permainan sudah berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tembakan bagus, Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:13:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuh Alat Siesta hebat.\NSama sekali tidak berguncang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah kembali kemari sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian mau memihak dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia yang sudah mencoba\Nmembunuh kalian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, karena dia adalah teman kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kami akan bertengkar\Nhebat setelah itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.99,0:13:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sepakat, 'kan, Char?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal kamu tahu saja,\Naku tidak sendirian, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi berdua, Yui dan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami balas dua kali lipat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yui... Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa depan itu takkan datang,\Njadi tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah siap, 'kan, Saikawa Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan Natsunagi Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf saja, aku tidak bisa\Nmelakukan tembakan peringatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kanan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus dari kalian dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cih.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yui! Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau pura-pura berteman sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konyol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tidak konyol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami adalah harapan terakhir\Nyang ditinggalkan Siesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak akan kalah dari siapa pun,\Ntidak akan ada yang menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan menang bersama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian ini kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teman, ikatan, pertemanan,\Nperasaan, tekad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa gunanya itu untuk dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saikawa Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia bisa diselamatkan\Ndengan kamu mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Charlotte Arisaka Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia bisa diselamatkan\Njika kamu membunuh Saikawa Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsunagi Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kamu sekuat Detektif Hebat yang dulu,\Ndunia bisa diselamatkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kenapa tidak melakukan itu?\NTidak bisa melakukan itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya. Kamu tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya milikilah rasa malu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan jangan halangi orang yang berjuang\Nuntuk menyelamatkan dunia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ucapanmu tidak salah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti ada orang yang\Nmenyebut itu keadilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi detektif yang terlampau\Nbenar sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin memilih pilihan\Nyang mungkin saja salah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, di akhir,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku ingin memilih masa depan di mana\Norang tersayangku tersenyum di sampingku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak mau membiarkan\Nsiapa pun mati lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita bertolak belakang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, mudah saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang berdiri terakhirlah yang menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hancurlah, kejahatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau aku tidak bisa melihat lawanku,\Ndia pasti melihatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pasti juga mendengar suaraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kekuatan ini pasti aktif.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kase Fuubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak bisa bergerak\Nselangkah pun dari situ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pikir kekuatan yang\Nkamu pelajari secara kilat itu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa menghentikanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian pikir bisa menghentikanku\Nhanya dengan tiga orang?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiga orang?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Robot itu sudah tidak berfungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak kapan aku bertarung\Nmelawan mereka bertiga?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, di mana dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka Kimihiko di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penilaian situasimu memang benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang harus diprioritaskan\Nadalah Char, Natsunagi, dan Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:18:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pasti bisa mengalahkanku\Nkalau aku bergerak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, satu-satunya\Nsalah perhitunganmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka Kimihiko, kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meminum benih Chameleon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Efek samping? Masa bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pasti marah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.83,0:18:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sekarang, aku cuma ingin\Nmemukul polisi menyebalkan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini sudah memutarbalikkan\Nkeadilan partner terkasihku,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}memukulnya satu kali\Nbakal memuaskanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar-benar yakin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak merepotkan siapa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah ceritaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besar juga nyalimu\Nmenangkap polisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak kusangka kamu benar-benar\Nmeminum benih itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu hadiah dari vampir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bakal mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, kalau terjadi ya biarlah terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, cepat kamu ke sana juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bukan orang itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian masih saja berisik.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.59,0:19:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi tidak bisa\Ntidur siang dengan tenang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noches, kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah cukup\Nmenyelesaikan misiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian berempat masing-masing\Npunya tantangan yang harus diatasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma program yang dibuat\Nuntuk membantu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Natsunagi Nagisa harus mengetahui\Nsiapa dia sebenarnya
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menghadapi masa lalunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saikawa Yui harus menerima\Nkebenaran kematian orang tuanya
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan membuat pilihan\Ndalam hidupnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Charlotte Arisaka Anderson harus bebas\Ndari belenggu bernama "misi"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menemukan tekadnya sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, Kimizuka Kimihiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu harus merelakan Nona Siesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menyelesaikan pekerjaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, Nona Siesta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak punya penyesalan apa pun lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa benar begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Walau bisa lepas\Ndari belenggu masa lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa dia benar-benar\Nbisa mendapatkan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akhir yang bahagia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimihiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menangis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siesta menangis tidak mau mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika memang ini yang dia inginkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia tidak mungkin menunjukkan\Nwajahnya menangis pada kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noches, kau menunjukkan\Nsampai adegan itu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena inisiatifmu sendiri, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ingin kami memperbaiki kesalahan Siesta\Nyang mengorbankan dirinya sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru itulah jawaban sebenarnya\Ndari permainan mencari kesalahan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimihiko, apa yang mau kamu lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar, Siesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak akan merelakanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski kau puas dengan akhir ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tidak akan menerimanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin tidak akan\Nada yang mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik itu Natsunagi, Saikawa,\Nataupun Charlotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.23,0:22:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, ini mungkin tindakan\Nmelawan hukum dunia!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, aku pasti
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.95,0:22:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan menghidupkanmu kembali!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku janji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka bodoh banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka memang bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bodohnya
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kimizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian bodoh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matahari sudah terbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, ini baru dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Detektif sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah cerita panjang\Nmenyilaukanku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk membawa kembali detektif.
